*{{Note|4|2}} – [[Joshua Dürksen]] was handed a five-second time penalty for a false start.<ref>{{Cite web |date=8 March 2026 |title=Doc 69 - INFRINGEMENT - Car 2 - moved before start lights extinguished |url=https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_melbourne_event_-_infringement_-_car_2_-_moved_before_start_lights_extinguished.pdf |access-date=9 March 2026 |website=[[Fédération Internationale de l'Automobile]]}}</ref>
*{{Note|5|3}} – [[Cian Shields]] was given a five-second time penalty for exceeding track limits.<ref>{{Cite web |date=8 March 2026 |title=Doc 68 - INFRINGEMENT - Car 21 - Track Limit violations |url=https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_melbourne_event_-_infringement_-_car_21_-_track_limit_violations.pdf |access-date=9 March 2026 |website=[[Fédération Internationale de l'Automobile]]}}</ref>
*{{Note|6|4}} – [[Dino Beganovic]] set the fastest lap but did not finish in the top ten, so he was ineligible to score the point for it. [[Laurens van Hoepen]] scored the point for setting the fastest lap among those finishing in the top ten.

